  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Indexing (index_document job, worker)",
      "items": [
        "The upload stores the bytes and queues index_document; status moves queued → extracting → ocr → chunking → embedding → indexed or failed (files/tables.py).",
        "Docling turns the document into Markdown (headings, tables); scanned PDF pages go through RapidOCR. Both run inside DAWAM.",
        "Passages follow sections and never span two pages; small child passages are matched, their parent section is returned (small-to-big)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "When embeddings are made (security flows)",
      "items": [
        "Only when the Workspace data-sharing level includes documents, an embedding model is assigned, and an internal-only Workspace has an internal model (search.py _embedder).",
        "Otherwise the file is full-text only; a provider failure also leaves it full-text only until a re-index.",
        "A new embedding model re-embeds every document (reindex_documents job)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Retrieval",
      "items": [
        "Query variants from the light model (rewording, other language, HyDE) when available; each is ranked with full-text and, where embedded, vector similarity.",
        "Rankings fused with weighted RRF, low scores dropped, results diversified (MMR), optionally reranked by a rerank model.",
        "Arabic normalisation is applied to both text and query so they match."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Not drawn / uncertain",
      "items": [
        "The query's own embedding call (search → embedding model) is not drawn as a flow to keep the direction left-to-right; it uses the same metered embedding role.",
        "Which file types skip Docling (plain text, spreadsheets) was not traced per type.",
        "Document AI knobs (chunk sizes, top_k, weights) come from Admin / Workspace Document AI settings (llm/document_ai.py)."
      ]
    }
  ]
